tok 1.0 "Job description handling"

pool org "Organisation"
  lane hr "HR clerk"
    start reported "Vacancy reported"
    task create "Create job description"
    xor confusion "Confusion in message?"
    task ask "Ask the Department again"
    task submit "Submit job description for consideration"
    task wait "Wait for approval"
    task correct "Correct the description"
    task post "Post the job"
    end posted "Job posted"
  lane dept "Department"
    task reject "Reject and request correction"
    xor approved "Job description approved?"

flow reported -> create -> confusion
flow confusion -> ask "yes"
flow confusion -> submit "no" default
flow ask -> submit
flow submit -> wait -> approved
flow approved -> post "yes"
flow approved -> reject "no" default
flow reject -> correct -> submit
flow correct -> submit
flow post -> posted
flow reject? Wait flow reject -> correct -> submit already. Duplicate flow correct->submit. Fine? Could just `flow reject -> correct -> submit`. Actually chain sets reject->correct and correct->submit. Then extra flow correct->submit duplicate may warn? Let's remove extra. Need flow correct -> submit yes from chain? Chain `flow reject -> correct -> submit` creates reject->correct and correct->submit. Good. So no separate. Also `flow submit -> wait -> approved` creates submit->wait and wait->approved.

Let's check this version.